{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Pass data from child views up to their ancestors.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/preferences"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit’s preference system enables "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"bottom-up data flow","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the reverse of environment values. While the environment passes data down from parent to child, preferences let child views publish values that ancestors can observe and react to."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system mirrors SwiftUI’s preference API and consists of three parts:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceKey","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]},{"text":": Protocol that defines a named value type with a default and a reduce strategy","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Type-safe storage that holds all preference values for a scope"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"PreferenceStorage","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Stack-based collector that manages preference contexts per render pass"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A built-in example is "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey"},{"type":"text","text":": a child view sets "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".navigationTitle(\"Settings\")"},{"type":"text","text":", and the enclosing navigation container reads that preference to render the title bar."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Defining-a-Preference-Key","text":"Defining a Preference Key","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A preference key declares what type of value it carries and how multiple values from sibling children are combined:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct CounterKey: PreferenceKey {","    static let defaultValue: Int = 0","","    static func reduce(value: inout Int, nextValue: () -> Int) {","        value += nextValue()","    }","}"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"defaultValue","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Returned when no child has set this preference","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"reduce(value:nextValue:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Combines values when multiple children set the same key"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default ","type":"text"},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation simply takes the last value. Override it when you need additive behavior (summing counts), array collection, or other merge strategies.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Setting-a-Preference","text":"Setting a Preference","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Child views publish a preference using the "},{"code":".preference(key:value:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct ItemView: View {","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Item\")","            .preference(key: CounterKey.self, value: 1)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Under the hood, this wraps the view in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"PreferenceModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"preferences.setValue(_:forKey:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" during rendering. The value is reduced into the current scope using the key’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" function.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Observing-Preferences","type":"heading","text":"Observing Preferences","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Ancestor views react to collected preferences using ","type":"text"},{"code":".onPreferenceChange(_:perform:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct ItemList: View {","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            ItemView()","            ItemView()","            ItemView()","        }","        .onPreferenceChange(CounterKey.self) { totalCount in","            \/\/ totalCount == 3 (three children each set value: 1, additive reduce)","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier pushes a new preference context, renders all children (which set their preferences), pops the context, and fires the callback with the accumulated result."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"The-Navigation-Title-Shortcut","type":"heading","text":"The Navigation Title Shortcut","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit provides "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey"},{"type":"text","text":" as a built-in preference key with a convenience modifier:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct SettingsPage: View {","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            Text(\"App settings go here\")","        }","        .navigationTitle(\"Settings\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"NavigationTitleKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" uses the default ","type":"text"},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (last value wins), so the deepest child’s title takes precedence.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"How-Preferences-Flow-per-Frame","type":"heading","text":"How Preferences Flow per Frame"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Preferences are collected fresh every frame. Here’s the lifecycle within a single render pass:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reset"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"RenderLoop.render()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"preferences.beginRenderPass()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", clearing all callbacks and resetting the stack to a single empty context","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": As the view tree renders top-down, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PreferenceModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" views call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setValue(_:forKey:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which reduces values into the current stack frame"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Scope"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OnPreferenceChangeModifier"},{"text":" pushes a new context before rendering its subtree, isolating child preferences","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Collect"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": After the subtree finishes, the modifier pops the context (merging into the parent) and fires the callback with the scoped result","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Discard"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": At the start of the next frame, everything resets: stale preferences never persist","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This per-frame reset ensures preferences always reflect the current view tree. Removed views stop contributing automatically."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Reduce-Strategies","type":"heading","text":"Reduce Strategies"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reduce"},{"text":" function determines how multiple children’s values combine. Common patterns:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Strategy","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use Case","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Last value wins"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"value = nextValue()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (default)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Titles, labels: deepest child wins"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additive"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value += nextValue()"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Counting items, summing heights","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Array collection"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"value.append(contentsOf: nextValue())","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Gathering menu items, breadcrumbs","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"code":["\/\/ Array collection example","struct BreadcrumbKey: PreferenceKey {","    static let defaultValue: [String] = []","","    static func reduce(value: inout [String], nextValue: () -> [String]) {","        value.append(contentsOf: nextValue())","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Preferences","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}]},"kind":"article","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceKey"],"anchor":"Protocols","title":"Protocols"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues"],"anchor":"Storage","title":"Storage"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/PreferenceValues":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A collection of preference values propagated up the view hierarchy.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues","title":"PreferenceValues","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PreferenceValues","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PreferenceValues","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/preferencevalues"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/StatusBarGuide":{"title":"Status Bar","abstract":[{"text":"Configure the shortcut bar at the bottom of the terminal.","type":"text